##api

##1.Admin

###1.1 Admin Login
POST http://localhost:9092/admin/login
content-type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{$dotenv ADMIN_EMAIL}}",
  "password": "{{$dotenv ADMIN_PASSWORD}}",
  "rememberMe": "{{$dotenv ADMIN_REMEMBER_ME}}"
}
###

###1.2 Admin Signup
GET http://localhost:9092/admin/auth/register-admin
content-type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "{{$dotenv ADMIN_FIRST_NAME}}",
  "lastName": "{{$dotenv ADMIN_LAST_NAME}}",
  "email": "{{$dotenv ADMIN_SIGNUP_EMAIL}}",
  "password": "{{$dotenv ADMIN_SIGNUP_PASSWORD}}",
  "confirmPassword": "{{$dotenv ADMIN_SIGNUP_PASSWORD}}"
}
###

###1.3 Forgot Password
POST http://localhost:9092/admin/forgot-password
content-type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{$dotenv ADMIN_EMAIL}}"
}
###

###1.3.1 Admin Reset Password
POST http://localhost:9092/admin/reset-password
content-type: application/json

{
  "resetPasswordToken": "",
  "password": "{{$dotenv ADMIN_RESET_PASSWORD}}"
}
###

###1.4 Admin Profile
GET http://localhost:9092/admin/me
Authorization: Bearer <paste-admin-token>
###

##2.User

###2.1 User Login
POST http://localhost:9092/api/auth/local
content-type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "{{$dotenv USER_EMAIL}}",
  "password": "{{$dotenv USER_PASSWORD}}"
}
###

###2.2 User Register
POST http://localhost:9092/api/auth/local/register
content-type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{$dotenv USER_USERNAME}}",
  "email": "{{$dotenv USER_EMAIL}}",
  "password": "{{$dotenv USER_SIGNUP_PASSWORD}}",
  "confirmPassword": "{{$dotenv USER_SIGNUP_PASSWORD}}"
}
###

###2.3 User Forgot Password
POST http://localhost:9092/api/auth/forgot-password
content-type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{$dotenv USER_FORGOT_EMAIL}}"
}
###

###2.3.1 User Reset Password
POST http://localhost:9092/api/auth/reset-password
content-type: application/json

{
  "resetPasswordToken": "",
  "password": "{{$dotenv USER_RESET_PASSWORD}}",
  "passwordConfirmation": "{{$dotenv USER_RESET_PASSWORD}}"
}
###

###2.4 User Profile
GET http://localhost:9092/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv USER_BEARER_TOKEN}}
###